# Odin build artifacts
*.bin
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
*.dSYM/

# Built binaries produced by the odin driver, which names output after the package
# directory. Anchor these to the .bin suffix the build scripts use — a bare `/ct_tests`
# also matches the source directory of the same name and silently excludes it.
/*.bin
/ct_tests.bin
/bench.bin

# Test corpora are NOT vendored — see TESTING.md. Fetched here on demand.
/vectors/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# The differential oracle links a locally built libsecp256k1; never committed.
/oracle/libsecp256k1.a

# Compiled shim for the constant-time harness. The harness sources themselves are tracked.
/ct_tests/*.o

/csuite_test
/libsecp256k1_csuite.a
/csuite_upstream_test

# The generated generator tables. Negated out of the blanket `*.bin` above: the
# embedded-table build is the default and `#load` resolves at compile time, so a fresh clone
# must have this or it will not build. Regenerate with `odin run precompute_ecmult/`;
# `tests/ecmult` recomputes every entry and compares, so a stale blob fails loudly.
!ecmult/pre_g.bin
